# The decision log is the example's input, not prose about the example. Without this
# negation the blanket `*.md` rule above silently drops it, and a fresh clone gets an
# example that raises SystemExit on its first line.
!examples/project-log/**/*.md
!docs/evaluation/m006.md
!docs/evaluation/m0065.md
/eval/results/

# The retrieval lab's embedding cache: binary .npy blobs keyed by content
